## 2. API Response Schemas

### `GET /api/notifications`
Returns the `NotificationListOut` object.

```json
{
  "notifications": [
    {
      "notification_id": "uuid-string",
      "title": "Transaction Approved",
      "message": "Your transaction of KES 500 has been approved.",
      "type": "transaction_approved",
      "is_read": false,
      "related_entity_id": "uuid-string-or-null",
      "created_at": "2026-07-27T09:43:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "unread_count": 1
}
```

### `POST /api/notifications/broadcast`
This is what your Admin panel form will send to the backend.

```json
{
  "title": "System Maintenance",
  "message": "The system will be down for 2 hours.",
  "channels": ["in_app", "email", "whatsapp"],
  "target_type": "all_members", // or "specific_member", "custom_selection"
  "target_ids": null // List of UUIDs if specific_member or custom_selection
}
```

